<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Basics:</>

Run					_F_F
Back Hop				_B_B
Super Jump				_D_U
Charge					^X
Burst				^B+^C

Light Punch				^A
Medium Kick				^B
Heavy Kick				^C

Low Punch				^A (crouch)
Low Kick				^B (crouch)
Sweep					^C (crouch)
(Knocks Down)

Air Punch				^A (air)
Air Kick				^B (air)
Heavy Air Kick				^C (air)

Slam					[_B/_F]_+^B (When Close)

<#f0f000>Unique Attacks:</>

Overhead Punch				_F+^C
Running Punch				^A / ^B / ^C (While Running)

<#f0f000>Special Attacks:</>

Uppercut				_D_DF_F^A / _D_DF_F^B
(Can Be Jump-Cancelled On Hit)
Sky Fang				_D_DF_F^C
(Immunity on Startup. Beaten by Grabs and Supers)

Light Mighty Kick			_D_DB_B^A / _D_DB_B^B
Heavy Mighty Kick			_D_DB_B^C
(Immune to Projectiles and causes a Wall-Bounce)

Aerial Light Mighty Kick		_D_DF_F^A / _D_DF_F^B (air)
Aerial Heavy Mighty Kick		_D_DF_F^C (air)
(Immune to Projectiles and causes a Ground-Bounce)

Mighty Punch				D_D^A / _D_D^B / _D_D^C
(Weak Armor on startup, can tank one attack.)

<#f0f000>Lvl.1 Super Attacks:</>

Super Mighty Kick			_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Dragon Form				_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Pegasus Form				_D_DF_F^A_+^B (air)
Titan Form				_D_DB_B^A_+^C
(Armor on Startup, can be grabbed out of and easily
punished if guarded.)
Trychaser 2000				_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A
(Invincible through startup but very punishable on whiff or guard)

<#f0f000>Lvl.2 Super Attacks:</>

Ultimate Form				_D_DF_F^B_+^C
(Long Ranged-Grab, unblockable but can be jumped over)
Ultimate Gouram				_D_DF_F^A_+^C (ground+air)
(Slams opponent into the wall, Kuuga loses 100 life on hit)

<#f0f000>Lvl.3 Super Attacks:</>

Rising Ultimate Form			_D_DB_B^B_+^C